# 股票交易系统

Personal stock trading web app: **factor analysis & stock picking**, portfolios, screening, backtest simulation. Market data is **read from PostgreSQL** (loaded by an external ETL).

| Area | Path |
|------|------|
| Backend | `backend/app/` (FastAPI, sync SQLAlchemy) |
| Trading engine | `backend/app/core/` |
| Frontend | `frontend/src/` (React 19, Vite, openKMS-derived design system) |
| Docker | `docker/docker-compose.yml` |
| Docs | `docs/` (`mkdocs.yml` at repo root) |

**Ports:** backend **8200**, frontend **3200**. **Config:** `STOCK_*` in `backend/.env` or `docker/.env`; `frontend/src/config.ts` for API base.

**DB:** app tables in `public`; market data in schema **`tushare`** — **written by an external ETL**, read-only in this app. Product focus: **factor analysis (因子)** and **stock picking (选股)**, not in-app data sync.

**Dev:** `cd backend && ./dev.sh` (venv, `python -m alembic upgrade head`, uvicorn). Use backend venv for Alembic.

**Wording / UI copy:** see `writing-style.mdc`.
